  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '

    The agent extracts useful parts of perception data whilst interpretting
    the user prompt using natural language processing (NLP), computer vision or other
    AI methods.


    Then it produces a strategy to meet the goals often using decision
    trees, reinforcement learning or other planning algorithms.


    Finally, the
    agent evaluates possible actions and chooses the optimal one. It may use probabilistic
    models, utility functions or machine learning-based reasoning to decide what''s
    optimal.'
